{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49930","headline":"满庭芳 · 吕岩","name":"满庭芳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道渊源，高真隐秘，风流岂可知闻。\n先天一气，清浊自然分。\n不识坎离颠倒，谁能辨，金木浮沈。\n幽微处，无中产有，涧畔虎龙吟。\n壶中，真造化，天精地髓，阴魄阳魂。\n运周天水火，燮理寒温。\n十月脱胎丹就，除此外，皆是傍门。\n君知否，尘寰走徧，端的少知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}